apes a simple, unadorned slate grey (青灰色) rectangular-cut cloak (披风) that falls to mid-thigh, covering his shoulders and upper back. The cloak's fabric is rougher in texture compared to the inner robe, suggesting practicality.\n\nHe wears plain, dark cloth shoes (布履) that are flat and simple in design, without any visible laces or decorative elements. The overall aesthetic is one of understated elegance, precision in historical detail, and refined simplicity."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 275, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [422.84503173828125, 164.31304931640625], "pos": [352.51849365234375, 120.50408935546875], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "SIGMAS", "slot_index": 0, "links": [239], "label": "Sigmas", "type": "SIGMAS", "localized_name": "Sigmas"}], "color": "#332922", "widgets_values": ["sgm_uniform", 25, 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 55, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "scheduler"}, "name": "scheduler", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "调度器"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "步数"}, {"widget": {"name": "denoise"}, "name": "denoise", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "降噪"}], "flags": {}, "type": "BasicScheduler", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#593930", "size": [315, 106], "pos": [360, 1000], "id": 17, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "BasicScheduler"}, "order": 19}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [303], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["vroid-style.safetensors", 0.7000000000000002], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 274, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_nam